 "convocatoria": "Reserva 4",
 "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_4.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-4-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "De entre todos los rectángulos situados en el primer cuadrante que tienen dos de sus lados sobre los ejes coordenados y un vértice en la recta \\(r\\) de ecuación \\(\\frac x2+y=1\\) (ver figura), determina el que tiene mayor área.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El vértice sobre \\(r\\) es \\(\\left(x,\\,1-\\frac x2\\right)\\), con \\(0\\lt x\\lt2\\). El rectángulo tiene base \\(x\\) y altura \\(1-\\frac x2\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='54.7,88.8 56.8,88.8 59.0,88.8 61.2,88.8 63.3,88.8 65.5,88.8 67.7,88.8 69.8,88.8 72.0,88.8 74.2,88.8 76.3,88.8 78.5,88.8 80.7,88.8 82.8,88.8 85.0,88.8 87.2,88.8 89.3,88.8 91.5,88.8 93.7,88.8 95.8,88.8 98.0,88.8 100.2,88.8 102.3,88.8 104.5,88.8 106.7,88.8 108.8,88.8 111.0,88.8 113.2,88.8 115.3,88.8 117.5,88.8 119.7,88.8 121.8,88.8 124.0,88.8 126.2,88.8 128.3,88.8 130.5,88.8 132.7,88.8 134.8,88.8 137.0,88.8 139.2,88.8 141.3,88.8 141.3,127.1 139.2,127.1 137.0,127.1 134.8,127.1 132.7,127.1 130.5,127.1 128.3,127.1 126.2,127.1 124.0,127.1 121.8,127.1 119.7,127.1 117.5,127.1 115.3,127.1 113.2,127.1 111.0,127.1 108.8,127.1 106.7,127.1 104.5,127.1 102.3,127.1 100.2,127.1 98.0,127.1 95.8,127.1 93.7,127.1 91.5,127.1 89.3,127.1 87.2,127.1 85.0,127.1 82.8,127.1 80.7,127.1 78.5,127.1 76.3,127.1 74.2,127.1 72.0,127.1 69.8,127.1 67.7,127.1 65.5,127.1 63.3,127.1 61.2,127.1 59.0,127.1 56.8,127.1 54.7,127.1' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='28.7,39.1 150.0,92.6 271.3,146.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='141.3' cy='88.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='147.3' y='82.8'>(x, 1−x/2)</text><text x='245.3' y='107.9' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>r</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 127.1H294.0M54.7 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='141.3' y1='124.1' x2='141.3' y2='130.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='138.3' y='141.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='228.0' y1='124.1' x2='228.0' y2='130.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='225.0' y='141.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='51.7' y1='50.6' x2='57.7' y2='50.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='38.7' y='54.6' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div>\\[A(x)=x\\left(1-\\frac x2\\right)=x-\\frac{x^2}2\\]<p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(A'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[A'(x)=1-x=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(½) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1,5) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(A\\) crece en \\((0,1)\\) debido a que \\(A'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((1,2)\\) debido a que \\(A'(x)\\lt0\\): en \\(x=1\\) hay un máximo absoluto<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><div class='res'>El rectángulo de base \\(1\\) y altura \\(\\frac12\\) (vértice \\(\\left(1,\\frac12\\right)\\)), con área \\(\\frac12\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "opt",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
