  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-4-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(I=\\displaystyle\\int\\frac2{2-e^x}\\,dx\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Expresa \\(I\\) haciendo el cambio de variable \\(t=e^x\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula \\(I\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(t=e^x\\Rightarrow dt=e^x\\,dx=t\\,dx\\Rightarrow dx=\\dfrac{dt}t\\):</p><div class='res'>\\(I=\\displaystyle\\int\\frac2{t(2-t)}\\,dt\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Descompongo en fracciones simples:</p>\\[\\frac2{t(2-t)}=\\frac At+\\frac B{2-t}\\iff2=A(2-t)+Bt\\]<p>\\(t=0\\): \\(2=2A\\Rightarrow A=1\\). \\(t=2\\): \\(2=2B\\Rightarrow B=1\\).</p>\\[I=\\int\\frac{dt}t+\\int\\frac{dt}{2-t}=\\ln|t|-\\ln|2-t|+C\\]<p>Deshaciendo el cambio (\\(t=e^x\\gt0\\)):</p><div class='res'>\\(I=x-\\ln|2-e^x|+C\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "cambio",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "racional",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_4.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-4-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Clasifica y resuelve el siguiente sistema según los valores de \\(a\\), \\[\\begin{cases}x+y+z=0\\\\(a+1)y+2z=y\\\\x-2y+(2-a)z=2z\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Pasando todo al primer miembro, el sistema es homogéneo:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x+y+z=0\\\\ay+2z=0\\\\x-2y-az=0\\end{cases}\\qquad A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\0&a&2\\\\1&-2&-a\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Un sistema homogéneo siempre es compatible (tiene la solución trivial)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\(x=y=z=0\\) siempre es solución, así que \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\) siempre.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&1\\\\0&a&2\\\\1&-2&-a\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- a^{2}+2+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(a-4+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-a^2-a+6=-(a-2)(a+3)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(a\\neq2,-3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\): compatible determinado, solo la solución \\(x=y=z=0\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(a=2\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\0&2\\end{vmatrix}=2\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\), compatible indeterminado. Con las dos primeras: \\(2y+2z=0\\Rightarrow y=-z\\); \\(x=-y-z=0\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(a=-3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\0&-3\\end{vmatrix}=-3\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\), compatible indeterminado. Con las dos primeras: \\(-3y+2z=0\\). Tomando \\(z=3t\\): \\(y=2t\\), \\(x=-y-z=-5t\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a\\neq2,-3\\): compatible determinado, \\((0,0,0)\\). \\(a=2\\): compatible indeterminado, \\((0,-t,t)\\). \\(a=-3\\): compatible indeterminado, \\((-5t,2t,3t)\\); con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "disc",
     "apartados": ""
    },
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "res",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
