  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-4-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula la distancia del punto \\(P(1,-3,7)\\) a su punto simétrico respecto de la recta definida por \\(\\begin{cases}3x-y-z-2=0\\\\x+y-z+6=0\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><div class='ex'><p>Director: \\((3,-1,-1)\\times(1,1,-1)=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\3&-1&-1\\\\1&1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(2,2,4)\\parallel(1,1,2)\\). Con \\(z=0\\): \\(3x-y=2\\), \\(x+y=-6\\Rightarrow x=-1,\\ y=-5\\). Así \\(r\\equiv(-1+t,\\,-5+t,\\,2t)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(1,\\ 1,\\ 2)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x+y+2z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(P(1,\\ -3,\\ 7)\\): \\(1+(-3)+2\\cdot7+D=0\\iff D=-12\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv x+y+2z-12=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[(-1+t)+(-5+t)+2(2t)-12=0\\iff 6t-18=0\\iff t=3\\]\\[M(2,\\ -2,\\ 6)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=2,\\qquad\\frac{-3+b}2=-2,\\qquad\\frac{7+c}2=6\\]\\[a=3,\\qquad b=-1,\\qquad c=5\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-28,\"el\":21,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.284,-2.87,7.577],[1.13,-4.284,7.577],[4.284,-1.13,4.423],[2.87,0.284,4.423]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[4.284,-1.13,4.423],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2.122,-1.878,6.245],[1.949,-2.051,6.418],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.949,-2.051,6.418],[1.827,-2.173,6.173],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.086,-2.914,4.171],[2.914,-1.086,7.829],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.914,-1.086,7.829],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.245,-1.755,6.49],[2.694,-1.306,7.388],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[2.346,-1.654,5.654],[2.795,-1.205,6.552],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[1.0,-3.0,7.0],[3.0,-1.0,5.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[1.0,-3.0,7.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2.0,-2.0,6.0],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[3.0,-1.0,5.0],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r4b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r4b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r4b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r4b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='58.5,18.0 26.0,56.1 263.4,246.0 295.9,207.9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='267.4' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='170.2' y1='120.3' x2='157.1' y2='109.9' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='157.1' y1='109.9' x2='147.9' y2='121.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='92.1' y1='219.5' x2='229.8' y2='44.5' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='235.8' y='44.5' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='179.4' y1='108.6' x2='213.2' y2='65.6' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m07r4b4d)'/><text x='217.2' y='61.6' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='187.0' y1='152.8' x2='220.8' y2='109.9' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m07r4b4n)'/><text x='226.8' y='119.9' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='85.7' y1='71.8' x2='236.2' y2='192.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='85.7' cy='71.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='92.7' y='65.8' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='161.0' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='169.0' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='236.2' cy='192.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='243.2' y='186.2' font-weight='700'>P′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='31.5' y2='275.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='31.1' y='280.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='38.1' y2='267.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40.1' y='270.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(P'(3,\\ -1,\\ 5)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}=(1,\\ 1,\\ -1)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(1+1+2\\cdot(-1)=0\\) ✓.</i></div>\\[d(P,P')=|\\overrightarrow{PP'}|=|(2,\\,2,\\,-2)|=\\sqrt{12}=2\\sqrt3\\]<div class='res'>La distancia de \\(P\\) a su simétrico es \\(2\\sqrt3\\approx3{,}46\\) unidades</div></div>"
    }
   ],
